   "body": "/claim cloud/i1450-sonnet\n\nPlan:\n- Add a pure rule in `FavoritesPresentation` (categorized = sort setting || on-demand flag) with a Swift Testing test, seen red first.\n- Add memory-only `showsCategoriesOnDemand` state, reset on sort-setting change, never written.\n- Add the toolbar/menu control with legacy labels (« Afficher toutes les catégories » / « Masquer les catégories »), grouped sort keeps « sections repliées ».\n- Legacy pointer header (`Favorites.swift:808-846` @ 87fe0d1c); `### Ledger` gap-new (Lists, GAP-1450) in the PR body.\n- Draft PR, Opus review, ready line on #893.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
